#
# retrologo.obj - The word RETRO as extruded block letters
#
# Geometry:   five letters built from 20 convex strokes, each extruded along z.
#             The word reaches +-3.000 across, +-0.705 down and +-0.403 deep, and its
#             front faces the eye at -z. Model y is the screen's, growing down,
#             so the letters stand up unrotated.
# Components: 132 vertices, no UV coordinates, 8 face normals along the stroke
#             faces, and 106 quad faces. The faces still carry a UV index, which
#             refers to nothing.
# Used by:    vectorlogo.
#
